# Portal runtime/state (never commit)
**/private/request_log/*.ndjson
**/private/*.sqlite3
**/private/daemon_state/**
**/data/cache/**
**/data/queue/**
**/vault/**
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/secrets/**
**/state/**
# Operational + PII state: aws-csm mailbox profiles carry real names and email
# addresses. The canonical store is the instance's own LIVE private tree, never a
# snapshot here; `deployed/` is a disaster-recovery copy and must never be
# versioned (PII + operational drift). The path of that live tree is a deployment's
# own business and is not spelled here — it was until 2026-10-04, in the one file
# the public cut carries verbatim with no filtering.
deployed/*/private/utilities/tools/aws-csm/
# Contact-roster leaflets (per-entity YAML under site-core/contacts) hold real
# PII — names/emails/phones. The canonical store is the LIVE webapps tree; these
# files are runtime/untracked and must NEVER be versioned.
**/clients/_shared/site-core/contacts/*.contacts.yaml
*.contacts.yaml

# Build artifacts
dist/
build/
*.egg-info/

# Agent worktrees created by the batch orchestrator. Each is its own checkout
# of this repo; committing them adds bare gitlinks that clone as empty dirs.
.claude/worktrees/
